      ],
      "message": "common: add HasGlobalRoute()\n\nAdd a function that asks the OS whether there is a route to the global\ninternet on IPv4 or IPv6, without sending any packets: connect()ing an\nunbound UDP socket only performs a route lookup and source address\nselection. Several well-known destinations are tried, and a route\ncounts only if a usable (e.g. not link-local) source address is chosen.",
      "committer": {
